    "name": "AlphaHunt Engine",
    "description": "AlphaHunt Engine is an autonomous real-time property sourcing and multi-channel outreach platform designed to eliminate manual lead generation bottlenecks in real estate investment and brokerage operations. Built as an end-to-end automated pipeline, it programmatically ingests raw listing data via structured CSV and API webhook integrations, executes automated data enrichment and skip-tracing to retrieve stakeholder and corporate records, and evaluates potential profit margins through a custom algorithmic scoring matrix. Featuring an integrated Large Language Model (LLM) orchestration layer, the platform dynamically generates hyper personalized cold outreach copy referencing specific asset details and stages qualified leads directly into CRM pipelines slashing manual sourcing time by over 80% and drastically accelerating speed-to-lead conversion",
